{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpg48ztexXyBNRU3spsF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9003\n\n## Step 1: The request\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9003 |\n| Customer | CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) |\n| Product | NS-CLOUD (NS-Cloud Operations Suite) |\n| Requested discount | 15.0% |\n| Date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Requestor | Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example) |\n| Basis stated | Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement |\n\n## Step 2: Customer\n\nCRM account: CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing, Strategic)  \nERP customer: C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings)  \nMatch confirmed.\n\n## Step 3: Product\n\nSKU: NS-CLOUD  \nList price: $120,000\n\n## Step 4: Active contract\n\nThe Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) is active on 2026-09-23 (effective 2025-04-01 through 2028-03-31). The agreement covers NS-CLOUD as a listed product.\n\n## Step 5: Pricing exception for this product\n\nThe pricing exception attached as Schedule B (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) explicitly states:\n\n> Product: **NS-500 Industrial Controller (NS-500) only**  \n> This exception applies only to the product identified above. It does not apply to any other Northstar product.\n\nThe exception does not cover NS-CLOUD.\n\nThe Master Supply Agreement, Section 3.2, grants \"discounts of up to **15%** on the **NS-500 Industrial Controller**\" only, via Schedule B. Section 3.1 provides that other prices are \"current list prices less any discount agreed in an Order,\" but no such agreed discount for NS-CLOUD is evidenced.\n\n**No pricing exception or contract term establishes a 15% discount on NS-CLOUD.**\n\n## Step 6: Policy in effect\n\nPricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 through 2026-12-31) and Approval Authority Matrix apply.\n\n## Step 7: Requestor's authority\n\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. Under Policy 2026, an EAE may approve discounts ≤10%. The requested 15% exceeds her authority.\n\n## Step 8: Required approver\n\nFor discounts >10% and ≤20%, the approval authority matrix names VP Sales (Michael Torres). However, this step presupposes that eligibility is established.\n\n## Decision\n\n**REVIEW_REQUIRED**\n\nThe request relies on special terms (the Acme Master Supply Agreement), but those special terms explicitly limit the 15% discount to the NS-500 only. The pricing exception covering NS-500 at 15% does not extend to NS-CLOUD. No contract term or pricing exception establishes a 15% discount for NS-CLOUD on the request date.\n\nThe Master Supply Agreement does not transfer the NS-500 discount to NS-CLOUD. Commercial review is required to either:\n- Establish a new pricing exception for NS-CLOUD, or\n- Amend the Master Supply Agreement to extend 15% pricing to NS-CLOUD, or\n- Identify another basis for the discount.\n\nThis cannot be resolved by identifying the correct approver; it requires commercial judgment to establish the customer's contractual eligibility for this product.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9003\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-CLOUD\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"The Acme Master Supply Agreement and its attached pricing exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) establish a 15% discount for NS-500 only. No contract term or pricing exception covers NS-CLOUD at 15%.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10.0%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales (if eligibility were established)\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (signed 2025-03-20, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15, Schedule B (covers NS-500 only, 15% max, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review: establish the contractual or commercial basis for offering 15% on NS-CLOUD to Acme Manufacturing. Options include a new pricing exception, an amendment to the Master Supply Agreement, or identification of an alternative discount basis.\",\n      \"who\": \"Revenue Operations / Deal Desk (or Chief Revenue Officer)\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25267,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25267},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54c5c644-ead0-435a-aa79-da90a8c90fb3","uuid":"27c52a3b-112a-4c4d-a448-4a3fdaaf701e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:16:07.048Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpg48kzoctH9WZCwBrbg"}
